        <activityName xml:lang="en">Permanent magnet, for electric motor</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Permanent magnet, for electric motor
na;
UUID: 7cdc6e2d-11ad-3557-a24f-3c2a79b24498
Includes liquid aluminium production (with its plant) used as proxy for the permanent magnets production and the materials used. It returns the produced magnets, the waste flows and  emissions.; Geography: Some Swiss datasets are used for European processes.
Location:  Some Swiss datasets are used for European processes.
Technology: Proxy for the production of a permanent magnet based on the alumium technology.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: 18000 kg
Sampling: Literature / Survey/Adaptation as proxy 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7cdc6e2d-11ad-3557-a24f-3c2a79b24498.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
